lute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">심ˉ-</rt></ruby><span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">酸<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">승ˆ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby style=\"position: relative\">꽈<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby> <span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">怨恨<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">완`훈ˉ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby style=\"position: relative\">꽈<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">後悔<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">효훼ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">付<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">후`-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">出<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">춛ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">青春<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">촁ˉ춘ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    goà sīm-sn̂g, goà oàn-hūn, goà hio-huê-hù-chût-chiēng-chûn\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative\">아<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˍ</rt></ruby>~ <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">失落<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">싣ˆ롷ˆ</rt></ruby>’에 심, <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">失落<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;positi